### Shift and cash-register endpoints
### Uses the REST Client extension (humao.rest-client).
### All routes require a Bearer access token.
###
### Roles:
###   - CASHIER / PHARMACIST: open, close, and request reopening
###   - ADMIN: review requests and reopen shifts

@host = http://localhost
@port = 3000
@base = {{host}}:{{port}}/api
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@shiftId = SHIFT_UUID_HERE
@requestId = REOPEN_REQUEST_UUID_HERE


### ================================================================
### OPEN SHIFT
### CASHIER or PHARMACIST
### Expect: 201
### A second open shift for the same user is rejected with 409.
### ================================================================

# @name openShift
POST {{base}}/shifts/open
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "openingCash": 250.00
}


### ================================================================
### CLOSE SHIFT
### CASHIER or PHARMACIST, owner of the shift
### Expect: 200
###
### closingCash is the counted physical cash. The API calculates:
###   expectedCash = openingCash + cash received - change given
###   difference = expectedCash - closingCash
###
### expectedCash and difference are always calculated from database sales.
### Client-submitted expected totals are not accepted.
### ================================================================

# @name closeShift
PATCH {{base}}/shifts/{{shiftId}}/close
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "closingCash": 320.50
}


### ================================================================
### SALES REQUIRE AN OPEN SHIFT
### Use this request to verify the active-shift guard at the sales boundary.
### Expect: 409 when the authenticated user has no open shift.
### The sale endpoint is currently scaffolded and will be expanded with the
### sales ticket.
### ================================================================

POST {{base}}/sales
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}


### ================================================================
### REQUEST SHIFT REOPEN
### CASHIER or PHARMACIST, owner of the closed shift
### Expect: 201
### Only one pending request is allowed for a shift at a time.
### ================================================================

# @name requestShiftReopen
POST {{base}}/shifts/{{shiftId}}/reopen-request
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "reason": "The closing cash count was entered incorrectly."
}


### ================================================================
### LIST PENDING REOPEN REQUESTS
### ADMIN only
### Expect: 200
### ================================================================

# @name listReopenRequests
GET {{base}}/shifts/reopen-requests
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ================================================================
### APPROVE REOPEN REQUEST
### ADMIN only
### Expect: 200
### The shift becomes OPEN and its closing reconciliation values are cleared.
### ================================================================

# @name approveReopenRequest
PATCH {{base}}/shifts/reopen-requests/{{requestId}}/approve
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ================================================================
### REJECT REOPEN REQUEST
### ADMIN only
### Expect: 200
### ================================================================

# @name rejectReopenRequest
PATCH {{base}}/shifts/reopen-requests/{{requestId}}/reject
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ================================================================
### DIRECTLY REOPEN A SHIFT
### ADMIN only
### Expect: 200
###
### This is the administrative override. Non-ADMIN users receive 403.
### Prefer the request/approval flow for normal operational corrections.
### ================================================================

# @name adminReopenShift
PATCH {{base}}/shifts/{{shiftId}}/reopen
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ================================================================
### AUTHORIZATION CHECKS
### Run these with a CASHIER or PHARMACIST token.
### Expect: 403 for each ADMIN-only endpoint.
### ================================================================

GET {{base}}/shifts/reopen-requests
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PATCH {{base}}/shifts/{{shiftId}}/reopen
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
